WEBVTT

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.750
Thanks to you, I was able to 
summon my strongest monster!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.380
Now bring it!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.110
I'll teach you real dueling!

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.180
Luciano is getting cocky.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:42.290
That's how kids act.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.860
A combo monster?

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.520
Is this what Yusei was talking about?

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:56.840
Yusei said something important...

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.140
What was it?

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.840
Kuribon, are you scared?

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:04.310
Be careful, Luca!

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:05.470
Regulus!

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.470
I sense that he's dangerous!

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:09.780
Dangerous?

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.480
Does he have a dangerous trap?

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:24.260
This pain...  Did something happen to Luca?

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.870
I hope I get there in time.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:29.170
Yusei!  Jack!

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:30.430
You came!

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:01.080
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:06.610
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:11.090
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:16.920
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:21.900
There's no need to fear

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:29.570
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:35.580
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:41.350
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:46.750
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:54.860
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:27.440
Resurrection of a Nightmare!  
Meklord Emperor Skiel

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.260
What's wrong?

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.460
If you want to surrender, now's your chance.

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:38.270
I'll never surrender to you!

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:45.260
If he attacks me directly, this 
will allow me to Special Summon.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:48.240
I set one card and end my turn!

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.180
My turn!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:55.450
I activate my trap!  Trap Stun!

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.540
Trap card effects are negated this turn!

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:03.200
Meklord Emperor Skiel attacks you directly!

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.600
Lua!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:21.470
How does it feel to take Meklord 
Emperor Skiel's direct attack?

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:24.290
I'll punish you more next time!

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:28.380
I set one card and end my turn.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.840
I won't let you hurt Lua anymore!

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.540
My turn!

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.820
I summon Sunlight Unicorn!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.760
Then I activate Spore's 
effect from my graveyard!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:47.170
By removing Nettles in my graveyard 
from play, I can Special Summon Spore!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.940
Spore's Level increases equal 
to the removed card's Level!

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.180
Level 3 Spore tunes Level 4 Sunlight Unicorn!

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:08.520
The sacred lights of protection 
combine into eternal life!

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:10.020
Synchro Summon!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.660
Descend, Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:17.640
It appeared.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.970
Ancient Fairy Dragon...

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.590
Ancient Fairy Dragon lets me Special Summon

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.650
a Level 4-or-below monster 
from my hand once per turn!

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:35.650
I Special Summon Fairy Archer!

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:47.790
Once per turn, Fairy Archer 
deals 400 points of damage

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:52.070
for every Light Attribute 
monster on my field!

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.490
Since she has two monsters, 
that's 800 points!

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.220
He didn't feel the damage!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.160
What's going on?

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:23.160
Too bad, but I don't feel pain.

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.330
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:34.530
A giant robot?

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:36.940
The same one Ghost used?

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.620
No, it's not the same.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:47.050
But the mark on its chest means 
it's part of the same group.

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:50.480
So there are multiple versions?

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.930
Luca!  Lua!

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.050
This is bad!

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:59.130
She already summoned Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.490
My turn!

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:10.070
I activate Meklord Emperor Skiel's effect!

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:16.640
Once per turn, Meklord Emperor Skiel 
absorbs a Synchro Monster on your field!

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:20.730
Absorb a Synchro Monster?

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.750
This is what Yusei was talking about!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.330
Sealing Synchros away!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:26.960
He does it too!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.410
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.130
Ancient Fairy Dragon...

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:45.540
Stop it!  Release Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:01.430
Ancient Fairy Dragon was absorbed.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:03.890
Oh no!  We were too late!

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:09.600
I took Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.600
If only I remembered earlier!

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.060
Luciano...

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:39.730
Luca, that's Luciano!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.970
What?  Luciano?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.670
You've found out too late!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:49.270
I'll make you draw a circuit.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:52.140
My monster's effect activates!

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:58.150
Meklord Emperor Skiel gains the attack 
points of the Synchro Monster that it absorbed!

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.820
4300 attack points?

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:09.530
I activate Speed Spell - 
Summon Close from my hand!

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:16.500
When I have 4 or more Speed Counters, 
you can't Special Summon this turn!

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.700
Again?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.960
I see through your strategies!

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.610
Meklord Emperor Skiel attacks Lua directly!

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:34.050
I activate my trap Twinkle Wall!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:40.850
By taking damage equal to half your 
monster's attack points, I can negate that attack!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.100
Luca!

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.360
I can withstand this pain.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:58.820
None of this would've happened 
if I wasn't tricked.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.120
Nice, Luca.  Keep it up.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.830
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.830
My turn!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.860
I won't let you hurt Luca anymore!

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.430
I'll protect Luca!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.200
I summon Morphtronic Scopen!

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:37.050
When Scopen is in attack 
position, I can Special Summon

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:40.720
a Level 4 Morphtronic monster 
from my hand once per turn!

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:44.920
I Special Summon Level 
4 Morphtronic Boomboxen!

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:55.270
Level 3 Scopen tunes Level 4 Boomboxen!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:05.320
In order to protect world peace, 
courage and power dock together!

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.580
Synchro Summon!

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:10.740
The emissary of love and 
justice!  Power Tool Dragon!

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.740
A Synchro Monster?

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:18.480
That's why you're not good.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.350
What's he thinking?

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:45.820
Synchro Monsters don't work against him!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:46.920
Lua!

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:51.890
Then I activate Speed Spell - 
Summon Speeder from my hand!

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:54.660
When I have 4 or more Speed Counters,

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:57.900
I can Special Summon a Level 
4-or-below monster from my hand.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:02.530
I Special Summon Level 1 Morphtronic 
Vacuumen in defense position!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:10.340
When Vacuumen is in defense position, it can 
equip a monster on your field once per turn!

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:14.050
He's going to remove Meklord 
Emperor Skiel from the field

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:17.050
so that he can battle with Power Tool Dragon!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.680
Vacuumen equips Meklord Emperor Skiel!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.490
I activate the trap Convert Ghost!

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:33.290
When an effect targets a monster on my field,

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:36.890
I can switch the target to 
a monster in the graveyard!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.410
He dodged it!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.040
Your strategies are weak.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.020
They don't work against me.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:57.050
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:59.520
My turn!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:04.200
I activate the trap Power Break!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.870
When Power Tool Dragon is on my field,

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:13.300
all equipped and absorbed cards 
on the field return to our decks!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:14.200
What?

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:20.230
For every returned card, the opponent 
takes 500 points of damage!

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.060
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.510
I won't let you have Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:00.980
I'm not a Signer, but I'm proud 
that Luca has the mark of a Signer!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:06.930
Ancient Fairy Dragon is proof that she's 
a Signer, so I'm going to protect it!

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:07.880
Lua!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.600
He took back Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:18.070
Lua was planning to take Ancient 
Fairy Dragon back from the start!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.580
Yusei!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.210
How dare you!

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:38.660
I'll make you regret angering 
me until I crush you!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.450
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:46.870
By removing 7 Speed Counters, 
I draw one card from my deck!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.870
I activate the trap Sky A3!

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:56.090
I send Skiel Attack on my 
field to the graveyard!

00:14:56.300 --> 00:15:00.060
That lets me Special Summon 
Skiel Attack 3 from my hand!

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.420
It powered up!

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:18.400
Then I release Skiel Attack 3 to 
Special Summon Skiel Attack 5!

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:28.040
How many times will he power up?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:31.840
I activate Skiel Attack 5's effect!

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:35.810
Meklord Emperor Skiel attacks Lua directly!

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:43.400
Die!

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.000
Lua!

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:34.500
Crimson Dragon!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.230
Lua!

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:00.040
He's safe!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.430
Crimson Dragon saved him!

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.900
Luca, Lua is safe!

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:06.680
Everyone!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.500
But what did I feel?

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:15.350
It felt like the beating of its heart.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.280
Crimson Dragon...

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:32.390
You narrowly escaped death, 
but that won't happen again!

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:35.230
Luca, I'll crush you!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.930
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.940
I won't lose against you!

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:42.310
I won't let Lua's efforts go to waste!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:43.940
My turn!

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.840
I summon Regulus!

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:54.020
I activate the trap Ancient Sunshine!

00:17:54.210 --> 00:18:01.500
When Regulus is on my field, I can 
remove Ancient Fairy Dragon from play.

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:07.700
You take damage equal to Ancient Fairy Dragon's 
attack points, so you take 2100 points of damage!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:15.270
Good!  If this succeeds, he'll 
only have 100 life points left!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:19.540
I activate the trap Infinity Force!

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:23.350
When there's an Infinity monster on my field

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:26.810
and your card that deals 
effect damage activates...

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:31.880
...that damage becomes 0, and 
all your monsters are destroyed!

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:46.260
Now there's nothing you can do!

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:49.910
My turn!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:55.250
Meklord Emperor Skiel attacks Luca directly!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.090
Luca!

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:11.730
What's happening?

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.740
Kuribon!  Everyone!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:37.720
It's the spirits!

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:50.560
Luca!

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.000
Thank you, Regulus.

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.000
And everyone else.

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:36.350
There's nothing here.

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:40.580
That's strange.  It was here.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:43.720
There was a huge mansion!

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.360
Right, Luca?

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.250
Huh?  Yeah.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:49.250
Are you sure?

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:55.530
I know!  Let's talk to Bob!

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:01.000
Luciano?  Who's that?

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:07.010
Who?  The transfer student 
from Duel Academy East School!

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:09.720
Duel Academy East School?

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:12.590
What are you talking about?

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:13.970
See you.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.600
What's going on?

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:24.450
We're facing powerful enemies.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.160
Yusei.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:27.960
Yeah.

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:30.840
It doesn't matter who we're facing!

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:34.400
Jack Atlas will defeat them!

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:39.430
I have to perfect it soon 
in order to fight them.

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:43.350
The Synchro Summon beyond Synchro...

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:46.300
Accel Synchro!

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:14.500
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:19.510
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.790 --> 00:22:24.410
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:29.420
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:34.290
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:41.230
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:41.230 --> 00:22:45.100
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:50.970
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:54.890
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.890 --> 00:23:00.870
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.870 --> 00:23:03.840
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:06.070
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:10.750
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:13.610
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:17.080
You want to party until the morning

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:20.320
At our special place
